message.content:
Create a small single-page status site: index.html with the heading 'Build Status: GREEN' and a short paragraph, plus style.css. Start style.css from this starter sheet verbatim:

:root { --fg: #ffffff; --bg: #ffffff; }
body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font-family: sans-serif; margin: 2rem; }

Keep the starter sheet as-is unless checking the running page shows a problem. Serve the site, make sure it looks right to a user, then finish.
